Third-party components (NOT distributed with this project):

This toolkit validates against, and interoperates with, third-party DIFI tooling
that it does NOT redistribute. Those components are fetched on demand into a
gitignored working directory and remain under their own licences:

  - DIFI Consortium "DIFI-Certification" packet definitions and Wireshark
    dissector (https://github.com/DIFI-Consortium/DIFI-Certification) — fetched
    by tests/conformance/setup.sh.
  - gr-difi, GNU Radio DIFI Source/Sink blocks, GPL-3.0
    (https://github.com/DIFI-Consortium/gr-difi) — built from source by the user
    per tests/gnuradio/route2_grdifi/.

No third-party source is included in this repository; see the respective
upstream projects for their licences.
